{
  "step": "Dynamic Analysis",
  "expectations": {
    "create": [
      "DYNAMIC"
    ]
  },
  "prompt": "Under the folder 'artifacts' are file(s) which should be reverse engineered. The file ARTIFACTS.md contains a list with all relevant files and their details. Under the folder 'STATIC' are the findings of the static analysis. Use these information to plan and execute the dynamic analysis. Create a folder 'DYNAMIC' which contains the findings of the dynamic analysis. Use the file DYNAMIC/PLAN.md to track the steps for the dynamic analysis and the progress. Before you start create a plan in this file and then work thru this plan. The file DYNAMIC/SUMMARY.md contains a conclusive report of the dynamic analysis. If something goes wrong create the file ERROR/DYNAMIC.md and document the issue there."
}
